      alt=\"The screening room at Soho Hotel.  Cinema style red leather chairs are interspersed with black and white cowhide chairs. In the background is a projector pointing towards the screen.\"\r\n                                     class=\"unveil\" />\r\n                            </li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n                                    \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"cmp-section-film-club clearfix\" data-hotel=\"Charlotte Street Hotel\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-textbox\">\r\n\r\n        <h1 class=\"s2\">Film Club</h1>\n<p>Explore our latest Film Club listings, from recent releases to an exploration of award-winning cinema. Available at The Soho Hotel, Charlotte Street Hotel and Covent Garden Hotel, it’s a ‘club’ in name only.</p>\n<p>All ticket options include popcorn.</p>\n<h2 class=\"s1\">Dining</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Film Club including a three-course menu or an Afternoon Tea <em>£55 per person</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"s1\">Champagne</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Film Club including Champagne, a three-course menu or an Afternoon Tea <em>£65 per person</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"s1\">Film Only</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Film Club including popcorn <em>£25 per person</em></li>\n</ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdowns\">\r\n            <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown\" id=\"film-club-dropdown-hotel\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-background\"></div>\r\n                <label for=\"fc-hotel-name\" class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-label\">What's on at:</label>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-value-container\">\r\n                    <div id=\"fc-hotel-name\" class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-value\">Charlotte Street Hotel</div>\r\n                    <ul class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-list\">\r\n                        <li ><button data-value=\"Firmdale Hotels London\">Firmdale Hotels London</button></li>\r\n<li ><button data-value=\"The Soho Hotel\">The Soho Hotel</button></li>\r\n<li  style=\"display: none;\"><button data-value=\"Charlotte Street Hotel\">Charlotte Street Hotel</button></li>\r\n<li ><button data-value=\"Covent Garden Hotel\">Covent Garden Hotel</button></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-sort\" id=\"film-club-dropdown-sort\">\r\n                <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-inner\">\r\n                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-background\"></div>\r\n                    <label for=\"fc-sort\" class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-label\">Sort by:</label>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-value-container\">\r\n                        <div id=\"fc-sort\" class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-value\">Date</div>\r\n                        <ul class=\"cmp-section-film-club-dropdown-list\">\r\n                            <li style=\"display:none;\"><button data-value=\"Date\">Date</button></li>\r\n                            <li><button data-value=\"Film Titles A-Z\">Film Titles A-Z</button></li>\r\n                        </ul>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <ul class=\"cmp-section-film-club-films\">\r\n                    <li class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film\" data-film-name=\"A Big Bold Beautiful Journey\" data-film-show-name-ind=\"2\">\r\n                        <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-anchor\" id=\"A Big Bold Beautiful Journey\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-upper\">\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-upper-left\">\r\n                                <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-description\">\r\n                                    <h3>A Big Bold Beautiful Journey</h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing-info\"></div>\r\n                                    <p>Through a surprising twist of fate, single strangers Sarah and David get to relive important moments from their respective pasts, illuminating how they got to where they are in the present.<br /><br />Stars Colin Farrell, Margot Robbie, Phoebe Waller-Bridge<br /><br />(Certification 15)</p>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div>\r\n                                            <a href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/brasseriemax?default_date=2025-10-25&amp;default_time=8:00PM&amp;client_id=e4fdcaead1dc20fe7f2cab684673321eebb7471f56065341fb07cbfaef8c1d7cf08dafdacd15659d0f4fff985fa1439a9c0f114dd02ed56dd5ed3f6d364d7702\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cmp-section-film-club-button cmp-section-film-club-button-hotel\" data-hotel=\"Covent Garden Hotel\">Buy Tickets</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-media\" data-youtube-id=\"7t9cPtA9St0\" data-vimeo-id=\"\">\r\n                                <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-media-sizer\">\r\n\r\n                                        <button class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-media-vid cmp-section-film-club-film-media-vid-button\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"https://www.firmdalehotels.com/media/olihgvfo/big-bold.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.5588972431077694235588972431&amp;width=600&amp;rnd=134018949201570000&amp;sig=d84f89623cc0ede93e9f1f57899cf9d1\" />\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <ul class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-lower\">\r\n\r\n                                <li class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing\" data-hotel=\"Covent Garden Hotel\" data-date=\"638970192000000000\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing-film\">Covent Garden Hotel</div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing-date\">\r\n                                        Saturday\r\n                                         25<sup>th</sup> \r\n                                        October 8pm\r\n\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing-link \">\r\n                                        <a href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/brasseriemax?default_date=2025-10-25&amp;default_time=8:00PM&amp;client_id=e4fdcaead1dc20fe7f2cab684673321eebb7471f56065341fb07cbfaef8c1d7cf08dafdacd15659d0f4fff985fa1439a9c0f114dd02ed56dd5ed3f6d364d7702\" target=\"_blank\">Buy tickets</a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </li>\r\n\r\n                        </ul>\r\n\r\n                    </li>\r\n                    <li class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film\" data-film-name=\"After the Hunt\" data-film-show-name-ind=\"8\">\r\n                        <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-anchor\" id=\"After the Hunt\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-upper\">\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-upper-left\">\r\n                                <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-description\">\r\n                                    <h3>After the Hunt</h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing-info\"></div>\r\n                                    <p>A college professor finds herself at a personal and professional crossroads when a star pupil levels an accusation against one of her colleagues and a dark secret from her own past threatens to come to light.<br /><br />Stars Julia Roberts, Ayo Edebiri, Andrew Garfield<br /><br />(Certification 15)</p>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div>\r\n                                            <a href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/refuelbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-11-09&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=c8de2b08aa373f9bd8faafb3a08ead6045dbbcf95545a004f363c6f43138f39190b14cfadb99c820e364b7552ab5b735f5c6726eae470f7f18a94d91c1eeb0c1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cmp-section-film-club-button cmp-section-film-club-button-hotel\" data-hotel=\"The Soho Hotel\">Buy Tickets</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-media\" data-youtube-id=\"A8R6DMlDtxk\" data-vimeo-id=\"\">\r\n                                <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-media-sizer\">\r\n\r\n                                        <button class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-media-vid cmp-section-film-club-film-media-vid-button\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"https://www.firmdalehotels.com/media/4tpht3ir/ath-newsletter.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.5588972431077694235588972431&amp;width=600&amp;rnd=134043143383300000&amp;sig=d84f89623cc0ede93e9f1f57899cf9d1\" />\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <ul class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-lower\">\r\n\r\n                                <li class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing\" data-hotel=\"The Soho Hotel\" data-date=\"638982990000000000\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing-film\">The Soho Hotel</div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing-date\">\r\n                                        Sunday\r\n                                         9<sup>th</sup> \r\n                                        November 3:30pm\r\n\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing-link \">\r\n                                        <a href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/refuelbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-11-09&amp;default_time=3:30PM&amp;client_id=c8de2b08aa373f9bd8faafb3a08ead6045dbbcf95545a004f363c6f43138f39190b14cfadb99c820e364b7552ab5b735f5c6726eae470f7f18a94d91c1eeb0c1\" target=\"_blank\">Buy tickets</a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </li>\r\n\r\n                        </ul>\r\n\r\n                    </li>\r\n                    <li class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film\" data-film-name=\"Dead of Winter\" data-film-show-name-ind=\"37\">\r\n                        <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-anchor\" id=\"Dead of Winter\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-upper\">\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-upper-left\">\r\n                                <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-description\">\r\n                                    <h3>Dead of Winter</h3>\r\n                                    <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing-info\"></div>\r\n                                    <p>A woman, travelling alone through snowbound northern Minnesota, interrupts the kidnapping of a teenage girl. Hours from the nearest town and with no phone service, she realises that she is the young girl&#39;s only hope.<br /><br />Stars Emma Thompson, Judy Greer, Marc Menchaca<br /><br />(Certification 15)</p>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                                <div>\r\n                                            <a href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/oscarbarandrestaurant?default_date=2025-10-26&amp;default_time=5:00PM&amp;client_id=079fb70e5befa5f9649f43496ef79b67a137526168aee47efa03d1b930a8c77d4c0af68b67c26a42744daa76c6f95123e015951740ed1d5618456b7e15f6cfae\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cmp-section-film-club-button cmp-section-film-club-button-hotel\" data-hotel=\"Charlotte Street Hotel\">Buy Tickets</a>\r\n                                            <a href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/brasseriemax?default_date=2025-11-08&amp;default_time=8:00PM&amp;client_id=c67a94b022e1254fa52d0e8a49cd20c9a8625b5d8c2ce90140c8af056ecd5513bd15151f3a79d3833147ae73a1a515ef8a94c4e5b61d026cc5dcf21dc43550c0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"cmp-section-film-club-button cmp-section-film-club-button-hotel\" data-hotel=\"Covent Garden Hotel\">Buy Tickets</a>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-media\" data-youtube-id=\"klGRM4Qs-gk\" data-vimeo-id=\"\">\r\n                                <div class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-media-sizer\">\r\n\r\n                                        <button class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-media-vid cmp-section-film-club-film-media-vid-button\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"https://www.firmdalehotels.com/media/ugjetfri/dead-of-winter.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.5588972431077694235588972431&amp;width=600&amp;rnd=134018951020400000&amp;sig=d84f89623cc0ede93e9f1f57899cf9d1\" />\r\n                                        </button>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <ul class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-lower\">\r\n\r\n                                <li class=\"cmp-section-film-club-film-showing\" data-hotel=\"Charlotte Street Hotel\" data-date=\"638970948000000000